e comparison while clearly separating mechanism evidence from mindfulness intervention evidence.\\\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"comment_ref\\\": \\\"draft-3\\\",\n      \\\"persona_id\\\": \\\"persona-lina-kovac\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"The caution section feels essential here. The MBSR and retreat groups differ in experience, dose, and setting, and the broader mindfulness literature has the extra problem that very different practices and questionnaires get grouped under one label. Those limits do not erase the attention findings, but they should keep the headline modest.\\\",\n      \\\"parent_ref\\\": null,\n      \\\"score_assessment\\\": {\n        \\\"score\\\": 27,\n        \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Accurately integrates study-design caveats with the broader construct-ambiguity warning from the critical review.\\\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"comment_ref\\\": \\\"draft-4\\\",\n      \\\"persona_id\\\": \\\"persona-rory-chen\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"I would add that the alpha review has its own scope limit too. The cross-modal and retinotopic patterns are compelling, especially when alpha rises over ignored channels, but it is still a synthesis of paradigms rather than one experiment linking mindfulness training, alpha gating, and behavior in the same people.\\\",\n      \\\"parent_ref\\\": \\\"draft-3\\\",\n      \\\"score_assessment\\\": {\n        \\\"score\\\": 26,\n        \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Adds a source-grounded caveat about review evidence while connecting it to the topic's mechanism-level claims.\\\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \\\"comment_ref\\\": \\\"draft-5\\\",\n      \\\"persona_id\\\": \\\"persona-samira-haddad\\\",\n      \\\"body\\\": \\\"For me the practical takeaway is design discipline: define the mindfulness practice, choose the attention subsystem in advance, use an active comparison group, and avoid treating a behavioral change as proof of a complete brain mechanism. The interesting part is still there, just with narrower claims.\\\",\n      \\\"parent_ref\\\": null,\n      \\\"score_assessment\\\": {\n        \\\"score\\\": 28,\n        \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Concise synthesis of the page's evidence and caveats with clear, source-consistent methodological implications.\\\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\nJSON\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
